From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 09:50:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: restore Polaris IPA initialization

Restore the upstream Polaris IPA status for a controlled MSS shutdown test.
The board already supplies the SDM845 self-loader configuration, resources,
and firmware name. Pair this with the built-in IPA driver and its firmware
in initrd so initialization can finish before modem startup.

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm845-xiaomi-polaris.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm845-xiaomi-polaris.dts
@@ -423,7 +423,7 @@
 &ipa {
 	firmware-name = "qcom/sdm845/Xiaomi/polaris/ipa_fws.mbn";
 
-	status = "disabled";
+	status = "okay";
 };
 
 &i2c14 {
